---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro'; import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro'; import DemoLabel from '../components/DemoLabel.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="For creators" description="Register affiliate IDs and see when HonorCart protects your referrals."><PageHero eyebrow="For creators & publishers" title="Proof your referrals were respected." lead="Register the identifiers you already use. HonorCart can show when it recognized your traffic, stood down, and protected the session."><div class="button-row"><a class="button" href="/signup">Create a creator profile</a><a class="button secondary" href="/dashboard">View demo dashboard</a></div></PageHero><section class="section soft"><div class="shell dashboard-preview"><div class="section-heading left"><p class="eyebrow">Creator dashboard</p><h2>A clear record of protection.</h2><p>Counts come from HonorCart protection events. Financial figures remain explicitly estimated until a network confirms them.</p></div><div class="preview-panel"><div class="preview-top"><strong>Overview</strong><DemoLabel/></div><div class="metric-grid"><div><span>Protected referrals</span><b>2,418</b><small>Event-confirmed</small></div><div><span>Merchant sessions</span><b>137</b><small>Unique, privacy-safe</small></div><div><span>Checkout value seen</span><b>$94,117</b><small>Not confirmed sales</small></div></div><div class="preview-table"><span>Network</span><span>Protected</span><span>Status</span><b>Impact</b><b>1,284</b><i>Verified ID</i><b>Awin</b><b>706</b><i>Verified ID</i><b>CJ</b><b>428</b><i>Pending</i></div></div></div></section><section class="section shell"><div class="three-grid"><article class="plain-card"><h3>Register identifiers</h3><p>Add publisher IDs, sub IDs, campaign patterns, or other network-specific signals. Sensitive credentials are never requested.</p></article><article class="plain-card"><h3>Verify ownership</h3><p>Verification states make clear which identifiers are claimed, pending review, or verified.</p></article><article class="plain-card"><h3>Review methodology</h3><p>Every metric includes its source and limitations so protection counts are never confused with network-confirmed conversions.</p></article></div></section></SiteLayout>
